customGetMainMenuItems.description:
Custom function to override the default column menu items. This function receives the column parameters and should return an array of menu items.
      <br/>
      <br/>
      Example:
      <br/>
      <code>
      const customGetMainMenuItems = (params) => {
        const { column } = params;
        return [
          {
            name: "Custom Menu Item",
            action: () => {
              console.log("Custom action for column:", column.colId);
            }
          }
        ];
      };
      </code>
